message: "If you use this protocol or its tooling, please cite it."
title: "debattable: debate tables for hard decisions"
abstract: "A protocol, templates and tooling for persona-grounded multi-agent deliberation run by coding agents: independent scoring, crux-based debate tables with anti-herding rules, timed fact-checks, judges, private re-scoring, and measurement against a no-persona baseline."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The debattable contributors"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - multi-agent
  - large language models
  - deliberation
  - debate
  - personas
  - decision-making
